#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "573268"
msgid "Are you hurt, #C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF!?\nWhat the hell happened!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "573464"
msgid "…hey, wait a second.\nWhy did I react like that?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "573700"
msgid "I reply, \"I'm fine.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "573812"
msgid "What's going on?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "573932"
msgid "#C236196003BB#CDEF……!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "573960"
msgid "Damn! She already caught up to us!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "575916"
msgid "IF you can.\nPerhaps you would like to approach it?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "576948"
msgid "Of course…!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "577736"
msgid "So―――\nSince dying here won't leave a Dead Log,\nplease don't die like a moron."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "577940"
msgid "Do so now, and I'll let you go back to the\nexisting regions and return to the old\nschool building."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "578184"
msgid "#C236196003BB#CDEF disappeared…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "578824"
msgid "You're strangely relaxed, #[Mr.][Ms.]# #C236196003#FAMILY#CDEF.\nWhat will you do now? Will you have yourself\na rest in a fox's lodging?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "579872"
msgid "……!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "580140"
msgid "……huh?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "580152"
msgid "Lo and behold…\nPerhaps you, too, are a worm?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "580392"
msgid "………………"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "580704"
msgid "…………"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "580716"
msgid "…………"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "581516"
msgid "――――――."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "581532"
msgid "…I see."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "581548"
msgid "I hadn't thought that far."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "581812"
msgid "I know I have a selfish ego,\nbut I don't want to stop moving."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "581876"
msgid "…even… so…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "581940"
msgid "#C236196003Gilgamesh#CDEF says nothing.\nMaybe he never cared to begin with."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "582024"
msgid "Why am I going this far for such a person―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "582640"
msgid "…!\nFine! I'm surprised that you were against me!\nYou had me hook, line, and sinker!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "583108"
msgid "So be quick.\nYou can't endure what lies beyond…!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "583164"
msgid "――――――."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "583752"
msgid "Khh―――…………!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "584028"
msgid "――――――."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "584076"
msgid "#SVT[She][He][She][He]# was probably the one hurting first."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "584408"
msgid "Don't come out of his mouth."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "584628"
msgid "――――――, ――――There it is."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "585088"
msgid "――――Why?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "585472"
msgid "――――――."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "585532"
msgid "Why am I doing all this?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "585560"
msgid "I mustn't put it into words."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "586128"
msgid "If I can, I want to swap out this dangerous Servant."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "586228"
msgid "But not anymore."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "586612"
msgid "#[That guy is][He's]# a fine partner."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "586712"
msgid "That Servant is necessary to me―――!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "587036"
msgid "I'll fetch a cup of tea for you.\nSo please, don't seriously consider\ngoing any further."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "587128"
msgid "………………"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "587436"
msgid "………………………………………………"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "587712"
msgid "――――#C236196003BB#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "587748"
msgid "And, an attack program."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "587864"
msgid "――――I can't dodge it."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "588064"
msgid "That's correct!\nHowever, I couldn't help but jump into action!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "588700"
msgid "―――#C236196003#SVT#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "588732"
msgid "#C236196003#SVT#CDEF, is protecting me."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "589316"
msgid "#[Mr.][Ms.]# #C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF.\nI don't believe what you've told me."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "589480"
msgid "I know what kind of person I am.\nThus, it's almost certain that I wouldn't\nanswer your summons."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "589632"
msgid "There's no sense in me answering the many #C000246204Magi#CDEF.\nIn this era, my deeds have long\nsince lost meaning."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "589752"
msgid "Then, why……!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "589932"
msgid "Still…!\nI know of the burden you carry."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "590240"
msgid "Heh―――Hee hee hee.\nHee hee hee hee hee!\nA splendid question!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "590876"
msgid "……!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "590884"
msgid "Go on, #C236196003#FAMILY #GIVEN#CDEF!\n…what? Don't fret over me.\nInstincts are kept away, backstage."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "591384"
msgid "Take care, #RUBS  Master#RUBEDarling#REND. I'm certain the me who\nloves you, and is happier than I am,\nis awaiting your voice."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "592028"
msgid "#C236196003#SVT#CDEF encourages me on."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "592144"
msgid "My disintegrating body and now\ndisintegrating mind flow into the cold sculpture."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "592232"
msgid "―――Now, what should I do?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "592388"
msgid "Yeah, as always―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "592444"
msgid "\nI call out that name, as always―――!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "593520"
msgid "……………errm."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "593540"
msgid "………is this the best place to do that…?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "593672"
msgid "I-I understand! It was just a joke!\nAhem.\nWell done, Darling!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "594868"
msgid "Not only was I sealed away so,\nbut for my Praetor to have suffered\nsuch disgrace…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "595816"
msgid "………………"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "595832"
msgid "I really hate to say this,\nbut my Servant is actually messed up in the head."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "596384"
msgid "―――!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "596396"
msgid "#C236196003Gilgamesh#CDEF, does that mean―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "596532"
msgid "Your enemy is my enemy.\nAid me, unrenowned Master.\nFrom this point on, I shall be your blade!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "596628"
msgid "Begone, #C236196003BB#CDEF!\nAnd wait patiently for us."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "596748"
msgid "Get lost, #C236196003BB#CDEF.\nNo one said you could be here."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "597372"
msgid "#C236196003BB#CDEF vanishes."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "598096"
msgid "You have yet to be defeated by anyone!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "598588"
msgid "Heh heh… heh heh heh…鷙\nHu-hyeh hyeh hyeh hyeh…!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "599028"
msgid "Alright! Let's forget about #C236196003BB#CDEF!\nLet's rush back to the old school\nand continue the doggy-play!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "599360"
msgid "Maybe I  W A S  T O O  H A S T Y?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "599888"
msgid "Now the battle begins.\n…thank you very much, Master.\nFrom now on, I'll accompany you anywhere――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "600068"
msgid "Apparently, I'm grinning right now.\nI guess he's exactly right."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "600144"
msgid "This arrogant Servant stated he would \"fight with me.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "600200"
msgid "Is there really any Master throughout\nthe entire #C000246204SE.RA.PH#CDEF that wouldn't\nbe after happy hearing that?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "601832"
msgid "#C080080080No, we HAVE to win.\nThis dilemma isn't exclusive to us anymore.#CDEF"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "601924"
msgid "#C236196003BB#CDEF#C080080080's goals are clearly insane.#CDEF"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "602244"
msgid "#C080080080That's precisely the last #ROFS0002#RUBS order#RUBEjob#REND #CDEF#C236196003Leo#CDEF#C080080080 entrusted me with―――#CDEF"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "603220"
msgid "Good. The gate is just up ahead.\nOnce you make it there…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "603404"
msgid "But――"
msgstr ""

