#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "667752"
msgid "After making a shortcut to the old school from\nthe #C000246204checkpoint#CDEF, please return to base."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "667856"
msgid "#C236196003#FAMILY#CDEF, you appear to have accumulated\na lot of fatigue. I recommend that\nyou return for the moment to take a rest."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "667992"
msgid "I'm concerned about #C236196003Rin#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "668036"
msgid "Searching the Labyrinth is nice and all,\nbut I should #C000246204return to the old school#CDEF to\nbriefly speak with #C236196003Kiara#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "668176"
msgid "I obtained the first #C000246204SG#CDEF.\nLet's briefly return to #C000246204My Room#CDEF and sort\nout the situation."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "668296"
msgid "First thing to do is activate the #C000246204checkpoint#CDEF.\nThat'll help move our search along."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "668396"
msgid "We took more damage from our fight with #C236196003Lancer#CDEF\nthan I expected. Now would be a good time to head\nback to the old school.\nLuckily, there's a #C000246204checkpoint#CDEF near us."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "668588"
msgid "What's wrong, Praetor?\nLet's #C000246204continue onward#CDEF!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "668652"
msgid "Don't worry. I'll protect you, Darling.\nSo, continue on #C000246204ahead#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "668732"
msgid "Surely you're not telling me that you're\nfrightened? Even you understand that stopping\nhere is impermissible, yes?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "668848"
msgid "#C236196003#FAMILY#CDEF. After you activate the #C000246204checkpoint#CDEF,\nplease have yourself a rest in your\nprivate room."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "668976"
msgid "Even in cyberspace, you need proper rest."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "669020"
msgid "Once you activate the #C000246204checkpoint#CDEF,\nuse it to get back here.\nI'll bet you're exhausted, #C236196003#NICK#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "669148"
msgid "#[Mr.][Ms.]##C236196003 #NICK#CDEF, return to base for now.\nLet's discuss our plan\nin the #C000246204Student Council Room#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "669276"
msgid "#C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF, please come back.\nYou've accumulated a lot of fatigue;\nany more will be dangerous!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "669384"
msgid "#C236196003Sakura#CDEF's worried state gets across to\nme even over the transmission."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "669472"
msgid "She's right, it would be best if\nwe returned to the #C000246204Old School Building#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "669564"
msgid "We obtained the #C000246204SG#CDEF. Let's return to the\n#C000246204Old School Building#CDEF for the time being.\nWe can come again after we recover."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "669712"
msgid "We got the #C000246204SG#CDEF.\nMission complete.\nLet's head home and get some rest."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "669796"
msgid "Where are you going? We secured the #C000246204SG#CDEF.\nThere's nothing urgent to tend to.\nBack to #C000246204My Room#CDEF, now."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "669928"
msgid "Hrrrm? Where are you going, #C236196003#FAMILY\n#GIVEN#CDEF? Where are you going,\nleaving me behind?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "670028"
msgid "For a second there, I was thinking about\nleaving #C236196003Gatou#CDEF and heading back,\nbut it probably won't rest easy on my conscience,\nso let's turn back."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "670188"
msgid "Wait, Praetor. If we're going to head back,\nit'll behoove us for the future to have\nthe #C000246204checkpoint#CDEF activated."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "670316"
msgid "Master, let's look for the #C000246204checkpoint#CDEF.\nIt should be around here somewhere…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "670408"
msgid "We don't need to walk all the way back.\nWe can use the #C000246204checkpoint#CDEF to reach the\nold school in a flash. Very nifty."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "670540"
msgid "M-my stomach is at its limit…\nI want to hurry back to #C000246204My Room#CDEF and get some rest…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "670640"
msgid "Before we go to the next floor,\nlet's #C000246204head back to the Student Council Room#CDEF.\nWe need to hand over the data we got from #C236196003Green Archer#CDEF.\nHe gave his life to entrust us with it."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "670848"
msgid "Huh? You're still in the #C000246204Sakura Labyrinth#CDEF?\nCome on, there's nothing to do there.\nGet your butt back here!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "670972"
msgid "We'll talk about what comes next tomorrow,\nso #C000246204come back and get some rest#CDEF.\nAfter, drop by the Student Council Room."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "671104"
msgid "We're in a race against time.\nWe need to hurry to the #C000246204Moon Cell's Core#CDEF――!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "671196"
msgid "I can't let #C236196003Shinji#CDEF's hopes go to waste.\nLet's press on so we can catch up to #C236196003Meltlilith#CDEF!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "671320"
msgid "Praetor, I've grown tired. Let us return\nto My Room and have ourselves a bath."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "671400"
msgid "I know how you feel, but knowing\nwhen to rest is also part of the battle.\nLet's head back to My Room."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "671504"
msgid "Darling, now is the time for rest.\nLet's return to our room and\nrecover our strength."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "671592"
msgid "What an impatient #[man][woman]#. Laboring away\nis not all there is to life, you know?\nWhen it's time to rest, rest."
msgstr ""

#. unk_op1650
msgctxt "671712"
msgid "You may now save your current game data\n            as #C000246204Clear Data#CDEF."
msgstr "Agora você pode salvar seus dados\n         como #C000246204Clear Data#CDEF."

#. unk_op1650
msgctxt "671796"
msgid "     You may use this data to carry\nover elements to the start of a new game."
msgstr "     Você pode usar esses dados para levar\nelementos ao início de um novo jogo."

#. unk_op1650
msgctxt "671876"
msgid "Please be careful to not overwrite\n  the data while you are saving."
msgstr "Tome cuidado para não sobrescrever\n  os dados ao salvar."

#. unk_op1653
msgctxt "671944"
msgid "Would you like to save your Clear Data?"
msgstr "Deseja salvar seus Clear Data?"

#. popupSaveBeforeQuit_line1
msgctxt "671984"
msgid "Are you sure you wish to exit"
msgstr "Tem certeza de que deseja sair"

#. popupSaveBeforeQuit_line2
msgctxt "672016"
msgid "without saving the Clear Data?"
msgstr "sem salvar os Clear Data?"

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "672048"
msgid "That's far enough.\nBeyond this point is the last firewall.\nI WON'T let you go further."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "672136"
msgid "Having your Servant freed after they've finally\nbeen frozen is unacceptable to me.\nI'll be removing you now."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "672248"
msgid "In a few moments, #C236196003#FAMILY #GIVEN#CDEF's\nSpiritron structure will be smashed into bits―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "672352"
msgid "!? Why are you interfering!?\nShouldn't leaving this person to act\nunchecked be suicide for you!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "672452"
msgid "After all, I AM instinct!\nOnce I have a thought about wanting to do\nsomething, I CAN'T stop myself!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "672552"
msgid "As a matter of fact, you're right!\nI can be so stupid it makes even ME nauseous!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "672636"
msgid "But this body is apparently instinct.\nBeing the idiot who can't neglect THIS\ncomplete idiot means I'm #[his][her]# Servant!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "672760"
msgid "I didn't want to hear that from YOU,\nbut I won't really deny it!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "672828"
msgid "However, this body is instinct, which\nprioritizes intuition. That instinct is crying\nout: \"#C236196003Tamamo#CDEF, fight on!\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "672956"
msgid "That's absolutely correct. If my reason is\nreleased, THIS me will vanish. That mongrel\nthere must understand that, at least."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "673084"
msgid "How thoughtless can one #[man][girl]# be?\nEnough for even ME to refrain from\ndenouncing #[him][her]#."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "673188"
msgid "#SVT[She][He][She][He]# hasn't gotten to know #C236196003#FAMILY #GIVEN#CDEF,\nand this should be irrelevant to #SVT[her][him][her][him]#,\nyet here #SVT[she][he][she][he]# is―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "673368"
msgid "#C236196003#FAMILY #GIVEN#CDEF!\nI don't believe what you're saying,\nnot in the slightest!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "673460"
msgid "The sky would fall down before I ever\ncontract with a commoner like YOU!\nYou and I are complete strangers!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "673568"
msgid "#C236196003#FAMILY #GIVEN#CDEF!\nI'm a nameless Heroic Spirit.\nI don't lend my hand to those who have power."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "673676"
msgid "#ROFS0002#RUBS   Magi#RUBE#C000246204Wizards#CDEF#REND chosen to be in the #C000246204Holy Grail War#CDEF are\nthose whom I avoid the most. There's no reason\nfor me to help you or accept your story."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "673876"
msgid "I'm an anti-Heroic Spirit whom people curse;\nand I curse back. I'm not worthy of being by\nthe side of one with a pure mind."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "674000"
msgid "As of now, I still don't believe that\nmongrel's words."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "674056"
msgid "Nevertheless, I believed you!\nNo matter what anyone may say, I believed you!\nOr perhaps I should say, mhm―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "674168"
msgid "To be blunt, I fell in love with you!\nAs if the very stars had fallen, it was love at\nfirst sight! For you, I offer my soul!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "674296"
msgid "I know you fight for someone other than\nyourself, for those who haven't given up…!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "674380"
msgid "That's good enough for me.\nI don't know if what you said was true or not,\nbut it's not a big deal."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "674480"
msgid "The reason is―――\nIf #C236196003#FAMILY #GIVEN#CDEF stretches out #[his][her]# \nhand, I'll gladly #[lend him my strength!][squeeze it tight!]#"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "674628"
msgid "If to fall in love is to die, then let us\ngo together―laughing!\nIf you were to ask as to why―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "674728"
msgid "Yes! For some reason, this person is the\nkind I like most in all the universe! I've\ndecided to live so I can fall in love!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "674852"
msgid "That's why I will do anything to protect #[him][her]#!\n#[Mr.][Ms.]# #C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF. So our relationship is proper,\nplease let me start calling you Darling鷙"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "675020"
msgid "Ha! This would settle it!\nAs if I would let this #RUBSstupid#RUBErude#REND person\ncontinue staking #[his][her]# life for me!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "675148"
msgid "#[He][She]# desires me for #[his][her]# own gain,\nand isn't afraid to insist that #[he][she]#\nis justified."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "675256"
msgid "To love such a shameless wish, such audacious\ninnocence is my task. If no one shall save such\nwretched humans, who shall?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "675380"
msgid "You're not wrong in doing this.\nMost assuredly, I shall sing loudly\npraises of your righteousness."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "675480"
msgid "Awaken me, and rely on me!\nThat, I'll entrust to you―――my Praetor!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "675552"
msgid "Leave the small fry to me.\nYou should do what you want to do.\nDon't worry about this form of me."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "675652"
msgid "…well, to be frank, ever since we met,\nI had a hunch this would happen."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "675728"
msgid "Alright. Time to go back to the battlefield.\nHold up your end of our contract, Master."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "675816"
msgid "Very well. Time for my first, and last,\njob as a good wife."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "675876"
msgid "Farewell. Your perilous deeds could have\nled you to hell, but you did superbly.\nI couldn't be any more glad."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "675988"
msgid "I truly can't believe someone would\ncare for me so much―――\nEven now, my tears won't stop."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "676084"
msgid "I'll face that thing for you.\nI have one last thing to ask:\nmongrel, what is your name?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "676172"
msgid "I laugh,\n\"I knew it. You weren't paying attention to me at all.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "676240"
msgid "This time I made sure to tell him\nmy name in a way he wouldn't forget."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "676312"
msgid "I see.\nThen go on, #C236196003#FAMILY #GIVEN#CDEF.\nYour recklessness here was a sight to behold."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "676412"
msgid "Knowing you, you'll surely entertain me. Now\nthen. By the contract which has written that we\nwill fight together, take back your sword."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "676548"
msgid "I stretch my now hollow hand out into the ether."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "676600"
msgid "I feel a defined shape in the palm of my hand."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "676648"
msgid "Such a doubt crosses my mind,\nand I immediately shut it out with a dry laugh."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "676728"
msgid "I hardly need to think twice about what I should do.\nThere's only one thing I CAN do."
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "676816"
msgid "#[Come to me][Please come]#, #SVT――!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "676856"
msgid "#C236196003BB#CDEF's voice echoes.\nIf I turn around, I can end this without experiencing pain.\nI can end this without losing my life.\nI'll be able to return to a safer space somewhere."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "677044"
msgid "It seems the electric current changed\nfrom warning me to attacking me."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "677116"
msgid "I was able to sense that from that current just now,\none part of my body internally collapsed."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "677212"
msgid "Wh―were you not listening to what that girl\nsaid!? The area ahead can only be entered by the\nperson in question! You WISH to die!? Fool!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "677352"
msgid "What are you doing!?\nWeren't you listening just now!?\nYou really will die!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "677428"
msgid "You heard that black mantle girl, did you not?\nBeyond here lies the road to hell;\nan underworld you can't return alive from."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "677556"
msgid "Seeing a person, even one I have nothing to do\nwith, helplessly burned to death would cause me\ngreat trouble. There's still time, come back."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "677700"
msgid "I understand the situation."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "677728"
msgid "But I'm sure that this is just speculation.\nAlso, this isn't the time to be resting."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "677816"
msgid "There's still a path up to #C236196003#SVT#CDEF's slumbering Core.\nBefore my mind gets worn down by the pain,\nI need to get over there somehow――!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "677964"
msgid "…what's the matter with this #[guy][girl]#…?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "678012"
msgid "The outcome is evident.\n#[He][She]# won't make it,\nno matter how hard #[he][she]# tries."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "678104"
msgid "―――Another part of my flesh internally collapses."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "678160"
msgid "I can't feel from my ankles down,\nbut I still have the ability to \"move my legs.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "678244"
msgid "If I can move, then there's still no issue."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "678288"
msgid "F-fool! I won't come to help you!\nI'll disappear if you wake that thing up,\nanyway! I absolutely won't help you!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "678404"
msgid "If you're hoping that I'll help, forget it.\nDo you even know what'll happen to\nthis #ROFS0002#RUBS  body#RUBEvessel#REND if that seal is broken?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "678552"
msgid "There's no sense in my helping you!\nGet back here before it's too late!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "678624"
msgid "……………well this is unpleasant. I can't\nbelieve you have no intention of stopping.\nOh, perhaps you're hoping I'll come save you?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "678756"
msgid "That's not going to happen. I did accidentally\nblurt out to \"leave the medical treatment to\nme,\" but it's all in your head."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "678880"
msgid "After all, if you awaken the me over there,\nTHIS me will disappear."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "678948"
msgid "If you're going to continue on despite\nhaving all this explained to you, then please go\nright ahead. I won't be saving you."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "679072"
msgid "If I wake up the #C000246204reason#CDEF,\nthe #C236196003instinct#CDEF will disappear."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "679160"
msgid "To the #C236196003#SVT#CDEF in that initial state,\nmy actions aren't \"inconsequential\"\nbut \"bothersome.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "679268"
msgid "I'm essentially an enemy.\nSo, this is better than getting cut down."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "679336"
msgid "…………but even so."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "679360"
msgid "This still hurts. Way too much. I think."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "679404"
msgid "The more I think about it, the less I get it."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "679452"
msgid "Maybe it's just my imagination,\nbut it's half as bright out now."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "679520"
msgid "It's a little―dark."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "679544"
msgid "My limbs getting heavier IS a problem,\nbut if the lights go out, my fate may be sealed.\nIn any case, it's getting harder to see #C236196003#SVT#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "679696"
msgid "Grrr, grr…\nYou wish for me to vanish THAT badly!? But what\nwill you do if YOU disappear, first!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "679796"
msgid "You'll make it if you turn back now!\nI'm not angry!\nCome back, my―――my, what was it again?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "679892"
msgid "But what will you gain from it!?\nKeep going, and you'll vanish before I do!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "679968"
msgid "Think it over! If you want to delete me,\nthen try some other way!\nI'll even consider giving you a hand with it!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "680080"
msgid "………get back here.\nYou made it clear that you're prepared to\ndie to have me erased."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "680168"
msgid "However, you must understand how\nreckless you're being? Your body won't hold\nup at this rate."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "680264"
msgid "I can still consider forgiving you if\nyou turn back now.\nCome back and I'll treat your wounds."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "680360"
msgid "I've still got another thirty percent of me left."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "680412"
msgid "I can make it. With this much,\nand keeping balance with what's left of my head,\nI should just barely reach."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "680520"
msgid "―――.\nMy body suddenly got lighter."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "680560"
msgid "Apparently, my abdomen completely vanished."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "680604"
msgid "Fortunately, my sense of pain isn't working very well.\nAll I feel is disgust with the sense that I've\nbecome a skeleton monster."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "680736"
msgid "Hopefully I'm quicker on my feet,\nas much as my body got lighter."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "680804"
msgid "Stop… can't you just stop…!? You should\nlisten to me and return! My chest pains me for\nsome reason! I can't STAND seeing this!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "680936"
msgid "―――Wha―agh, enough!\nIf you're trying to impress #RUBS  someone#RUBEa beauty#REND,\nyou're pressing your luck…!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "681052"
msgid "I can't watch this.\nYou can't make it no matter what!\nMy chest is banging for some reason!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "681144"
msgid "Listen! I'm not mad, so come on baaaackk!\nIf you don't, you'll make me suffer even more!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "681236"
msgid "However, now we're in the right order."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "681276"
msgid "#SVT[She][He][She][He]# believed in #C236196003#FAMILY #GIVEN#CDEF\nand raced to that starry sky, similar to the depths of hell."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "681404"
msgid "Come ON, though. I'm losing my cool."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "681444"
msgid "That Servant there isn't saying anything to me."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "681492"
msgid "There he is, not even lifting a finger,\ndespite staring straight at me,"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "681564"
msgid "Yet, even words like, \"keep it up,\" or, \"quit it,\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "681616"
msgid "Ah, now I kind of―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "681640"
msgid "Have a feeling that I'm starting to\nunderstand why I've been going so far to do this."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "681728"
msgid "That's #C236196003#SVT#CDEF's true form.\n#C236196003#SVT#CDEF fell with me into the Imaginary Number Space\nand ended up frozen. This is #SVT[her][his][her][his]# mind."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "681896"
msgid "That's #C236196003Gilgamesh#CDEF's true form.\nHe fell into the Imaginary Number Space\nalongside #C236196003#FAMILY #GIVEN#CDEF and ended up frozen.\nThis is his mind."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "682064"
msgid "\nIf I can just―――If I can just, free it―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "682116"
msgid "I don't understand. I just don't understand…!\nLeave my memory be!\nWhy do you go to such lengths!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "682216"
msgid "This is incomprehensible.\nYou're going to release my memories?\nWhat's the point in that?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "682308"
msgid "Is there something about that me that\nmakes it worth it to do all this…!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "682384"
msgid "Ah, ahh, ah―――\nIt's happening again… someone important―――\nto me―――is going to disappear―――!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "682492"
msgid "I-I don't understand!\nI truly don't understand!\nWhy are you taking it so far!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "682572"
msgid "It's just my memories!\nThey should be of no importance to you…!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "682640"
msgid "―――#C236196003#SVT#CDEF's voice makes an impact on me."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "682700"
msgid "\n\n\nOnce, I had lost my memories of #C236196003#SVT#CDEF and me."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "682764"
msgid "I saw #C236196003#SVT#CDEF's face, which looked disappointed\nand regretful for that loss."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "682856"
msgid "\n…that's enough of a reason.\nI have no regrets or hesitation in putting my\nentire soul on the line for this."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "682968"
msgid "Of course.\nI know the reason why I reached this point."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "683024"
msgid "There's no reason to stake my life.\nThere's no reason for #C236196003Gilgamesh#CDEF to nitpick about."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "683128"
msgid "For the longest, longest time I thought, \n\"I want to swap him out.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "683196"
msgid "I'm starting to trust him.\nI don't want to admit it,\nbut I'm starting to think he's not so bad."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "683292"
msgid "I confess that there have even been\ntimes I respected him."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "683352"
msgid "I sense that his \"anger towards people\"\nhidden in his every word, is a just thing."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "683436"
msgid "…that's the sort of #RUBS  thing#RUBEreason#REND I'm moving forward for."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "683512"
msgid "#[That guy][He]# made a contract with me.\nSo I can't allow it to be reneged halfway.\nI don't have the slightest intention of letting\nsuch a strong Servant go."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "683672"
msgid "Despite me being an inexperienced Master,\nhe accompanied me without ever once abandoning me."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "683768"
msgid "Even you won't make it out in one piece if\nyou go beyond this point.\nTake it easy. Give up."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "683860"
msgid "Our travels together end here.\nForget about going any further."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "683924"
msgid "Y-yes. You did well to return.\nYou must've had a painful experience. Mhm.\nI, too, don't take painful things very well."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "684044"
msgid "Ah, good, you're ba………\nWhat are you DOING to yourself?\nYou want to vanish into thin air!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "684140"
msgid "Ahh, ahh…! You did well to return…!\nThat's right, there's no need to go up ahead.\nPlease stay here and be still."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "684256"
msgid "What was that!?\n#C236196003#FAMILY #GIVEN#CDEF, were you injured\nat all!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "684332"
msgid "Hey, did you get hurt!?\nWhat the hell happened!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "684384"
msgid "Awaaa! What in the world was that!?\n#[Mr.][Ms.]# #C236196003#FAMILY#CDEF, were you injured!?\nI can handle any medical treatme―――!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "684520"
msgid "Stop! Don't move, #C236196003#FAMILY#CDEF…!\nThat's a trap to ward off grave-robbers.\nIt's not something you can endur―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "684648"
msgid "――――Hrm.\nWhat am I getting so passionate about?\n…you there. How grievous is your wound?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "684744"
msgid "The moment I tried to go past this point,\na current of electricity ran through my entire body.\nI don't see anything that looks like a trap though."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "684892"
msgid "It's #SVT[her][his][her][his]# organic current, rejecting Spiritrons\nof other wavelengths; like what you humans call\n\"leukocytes,\" it attacks any harm that enters."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "685056"
msgid "Hrm? Who are you…!? I can tell from a\nglance at your face that you're an imp, but…\nYou're not materialized, are you?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "685176"
msgid "Another visitor, huh? I haven't seen your\nface before… so, a hologram?\nYou're transmitting from another area, right?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "685296"
msgid "―――How filthy.\n#[Mr.][Ms.]# #C236196003#FAMILY#CDEF may be a rude person, but it\nappears you're less than an animal: a worm."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "685424"
msgid "Consider yourself lucky that your body is\na projection. If you were materialized, I would\nerase you off the face of this world."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "685552"
msgid "…I didn't expect a type of demon to appear\nas well. And the types don't get any\nmore \"woman\" than hers."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "685660"
msgid "You're merely projecting your consciousness from\na different area, it seems, but it's enough to\nmake me nauseous. State your business, woman."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "685804"
msgid "Yes, I'm unable to enter this place as I am.\nFor this is a Servant's Spiritron core…\nThe inside of #C236196003#SVT#CDEF's mind."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "685936"
msgid "Though my computational power has expanded,\nI can't read in this format. Sending my eyes\nand voice in like this is my limit."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "686064"
msgid "This is the inside of #C236196003#SVT#CDEF's mind―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "686120"
msgid "Then, just like with #C236196003Rin#CDEF and #C236196003Rani#CDEF,\nthe sculpture chiseled into that wall\nis #C236196003#SVT#CDEF's True Self…!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "686264"
msgid "You're right. When #C236196003#SVT#CDEF fell into the \nImaginary Number Space, a defense mechanism\ncaused #SVT[her][him][her][him]# to enter a hibernative rest."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "686428"
msgid "To fend off the Spiritron collapse occurring\none minute later, #SVT[she][he][she][he]# stopped #SVT[her][his][her][his]# own time."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "686560"
msgid "―――#SVT[She][He][She][He]#'s frozen, basically.\nThat wall IS your Servant,\nprotected from collapse by being frozen."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "686680"
msgid "The Servant beside you is the instinct\nfunctioning to protect their #C000246204True Self#CDEF―――\nThat there is your Servant's initial state."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "686824"
msgid "Oh? So that's how it is. I see, that makes\nsense. You're wicked on the outside, but your\nknowledge is vast."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "686932"
msgid "So then, if I rouse my sleeping self over\nthere, I'll regain all my experience, correct?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "687024"
msgid "…got it. I pretty much guessed it.\nI won't bother asking about why this\nall happened to me."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "687120"
msgid "If this #ROFS0002#RUBS  body#RUBEvessel#REND is instinct, that must be\nexperience and memory. If I undo that seal,\nmy experience should come back, no?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "687272"
msgid "………I'm not very pleased with it,\nbut I understand the situation now."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "687344"
msgid "So presently, I've reverted to a newborn #RUBS  form#RUBEstate#REND.\nIf I wake up the me over there, will I\nreturn to my previous self?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "687480"
msgid "So that's how it is.\nIndeed, that should explain why the ire\nwithin me is lacking."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "687564"
msgid "Then the me of that wall,\nas this mongrel claims, is the me\nwhich assisted #[him][her]# on some whim."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "687668"
msgid "So you're saying that if I awaken it,\nthe memories I had forgotten will return?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "687748"
msgid "Perhaps not. Being in this state matters not\nto me. I only came this far out of curiosity\nfor what that thing was."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "687864"
msgid "So long as I know the truth, there's no need for\nme to draw near. No, if I had to say, I'd prefer\nnot to. So much that I couldn't go alone."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "688004"
msgid "What a silly question. I wanted to know what\nthat thing really was, is all. I never had\nany intention of freeing it."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "688124"
msgid "Actually, I'd rather get far away from it.\nI don't want to carry the extra weight of\nmemories I've never seen or known of."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "688248"
msgid "There isn't any chance for such a thing.\nSo long as I know that wall is the real me,\nI have no need to confirm it."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "688364"
msgid "I had no wish to approach myself in the first\nplace. I'm not the foolish sort of woman who\ngets enchanted by narcissus flowers."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "688492"
msgid "I haven't the desire to. Now that I've\nascertained that that is my memory, there's\nno need to check the contents."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "688608"
msgid "Rather, I'll let it slumber as it is. To have\nassisted a mongrel such as this here?\nEven I must restrain my capriciousness."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "688732"
msgid "I'd say that's fair.\nYou are #C000246204instinct#CDEF. THAT, is #C000246204reason#CDEF.\nWhen #C000246204reason#CDEF awakens, #C000246204instinct#CDEF is suppressed."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "688900"
msgid "I'm sure even you don't want to disappear.\nPlease sit still and continue waiting within\nyourself for your next summoner."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "689024"
msgid "I suddenly got an idea.\nThis situation is the same situation as\nin the \"preliminary school building.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "689128"
msgid "Back then, I kept seeing dreams of the preliminaries.\n#C236196003#SVT#CDEF, right now, may be in the same state as I was then."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "689256"
msgid "#C236196003BB#CDEF said that #SVT[her][his][her][his]# \"reasoning is asleep.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "689336"
msgid "So, if I do the same thing #C236196003#SVT#CDEF did back then,\nI'm sure that will―――!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "689428"
msgid "…slow, aren't you? Beyond this point\nis an area with a Spiritron core.\nAny and all outsiders will be attacked."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "689540"
msgid "#RUBS        data protection#RUBEWithout backup#REND from the Student Council Room,\nforeign elements will be promptly disassembled."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "689672"
msgid "Understand, Senpai?\nIf you go past this point, you'll be\ntreated as a virus and be taken apart."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "689768"
msgid "I sent my voice here because… it's a waste of\nresources to have my cheeky rebel destroy\n#[himself][herself]# in a place like this."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "689900"
msgid "I've decided that while the Student Council\nmembers live, I need to use your life effectiv-\nely. I'll make cautionary media out of you."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "690036"
msgid "Take this as a warning, from me:\ngo any further and you'll die.\nBe good and turn back."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "690124"
msgid "Okay? I created a gate at the coordinates you\nwere teleported to.\nPlease use it to come back, Senpai."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "690228"
msgid "I guess she can't intervene like she's done in\nthe past because this space is a mental image of #C236196003#SVT#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "690348"
msgid "So the exploration ends here. Sounds like the\narea ahead always had this structure. It's not\nthat the black mantle woman is blocking us."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "690488"
msgid "As I know what it is, I have no more business\nwith it, nor do I care to get closer. What will\nyou do now, my… #C236196003#FAMILY #GIVEN#CDEF?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "690632"
msgid "…so, our travels together end here.\nLooks like up ahead is a walk of death,\nfor anyone other than me."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "690736"
msgid "What are your plans?\nI think there's no more reason for you\nto continue on."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "690812"
msgid "The mystery has been completely solved.\nThere's no longer any reason for me―or you―\nto proceed ahead."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "690916"
msgid "Our time was short, but I'm much obliged.\n…umm… I would feel bad if I told you to get\nthe hell out, so won't you rest here a while?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "691052"
msgid "…hmph. A surprisingly short journey.\nBut alas, beyond is an electrified path of\ndeath. So you can't proceed anyway."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "691172"
msgid "I'll return to my original location.\nAs a reward for leading me here,\nI could accompany you to the entrance―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "691288"
msgid "Or will you continue ahead?\nIf you wish for me to remember,\nthere's no other way to do so, it seems."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "691392"
msgid "…what am I going to do?\nI'm being asked what I'll do?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "691448"
msgid "No need to even think twice.\nIf #C236196003#SVT#CDEF is up ahead, still sleeping, I'll―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "691544"
msgid "…bring it on.\nI've seen that cynical face one too many times,\nand it's got me going, now."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "691636"
msgid "He wants to know what I'm going to do?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "691676"
msgid "No need to even think twice.\nIf #C236196003#SVT#CDEF is up ahead, still sleeping, I'll―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "691772"
msgid "Sorry for the wait!\nYour voice, your pain, your heart――\nthey've reached me loud and clear, #RUBS  Master#RUBEPraetor#REND!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "691900"
msgid "Even if you don't recall my True Name,\nyou and I are of one flesh. Because of that,\nI shall entrust you with my all!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "692020"
msgid "My Noble Phantasm, my heart is yours, Praetor!\nTake it! As you are now, you'll wield\nit perfectly!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "692120"
msgid "I did hear your voice…! Your stubbornness,\nrisking your life to the brink, truly makes you\nthe perfect idiot for this fool to work for!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "692260"
msgid "Even if my memories are stolen, even if I lose\nsight of myself, there's only one person I\nentrusted with my blades. I'll prove it now."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "692396"
msgid "There's no need to hide my trump card\nany longer. It's time to use my Noble Phantasm,\nMaster!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "692492"
msgid "Kyaa☆ I sincerely apologize for the wait!\nWhether I'm in the Heavenly Cave or eating\nsilken tofu, when love calls, I come at once!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "692624"
msgid "Let those who are far hear me, let those who are\nnear approach and see me, please! The magical\ngirl, lovely #C236196003Tamamo#CDEF has arrived!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "692768"
msgid "H-huh?\nShoot, did I mess up? Should I have refrained\nfrom dropping a practical joke here…?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "692860"
msgid "The sounds of your honest soul have\nreached my clouded heart, loud and clear."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "692940"
msgid "Even if you don't recall my True Name,\nYOU are my Master―――I, #C236196003Caster#CDEF, shall answer\nyour call with my entire soul."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "693076"
msgid "Ready! Reveal my Noble Phantasm!\nUse the #RUBS   Suiten Nikko Amaterasu Yano Shizuishi#RUBEEightfold Blessing of Amaterasu#REND\nas you see fit!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "693220"
msgid "Don't deafen me with your shouts.\nI can hear you just fine."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "693280"
msgid "You're something else―――\nFor someone so small, your voice,\nat least, carries far."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "693368"
msgid "But what's with this appearance?\nAlthough you always look quite plain,\nyou're looking shoddier than usual."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "693476"
msgid "I get the urge to lament that THIS is my Master,\nall the same. It is what it is. Supporting an\nincompetent contractor is yet another task."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "693616"
msgid "I shall allow use of my greatest treasure\nin this world only. Use the #C236196003King of Heroes#CDEF'\ntrue power as you see fit."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "693748"
msgid "After #C236196003#SVT#CDEF calls to me,\nevery one of my missing parts is restored."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "693832"
msgid "This space is a mental image of #C236196003#SVT#CDEF.\n#C236196003#FAMILY #GIVEN#CDEF was perceived as a\nforeign body until now.\nIn this moment, I became foreign to #SVT[her][him][her][him]# no longer."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "694036"
msgid "This can't be―#SVT[her][his][her][his]# Noble Phantasm\nwas unsealed…!? Senpai shouldn't be capable\nof developing this much…!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "694164"
msgid "Right now, I'm flaring with joy.\nAnd at the same time, I'm blazing with anger!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "694244"
msgid "You make the #[man][girl]# you hold dear play the role of\nDiana's hunting dog… mhm. This is \"perverted\nbeauty.\" It's not bad. I'll reward you."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "694388"
msgid "I'll swing my sword all about for you.\nCome now, no need to be modest.\nI won't be showing you any mercy either."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "694500"
msgid "Be enraptured. Then give praise, then apologize.\nI am the supreme and highest instrument―――\nNaturally, I'll return the disgrace tenfold!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "694640"
msgid "Did this fall outside of your calculations?\nI get it, I've been racking my brain from the\nbeginning myself. This #[guy][girl]# is too reckless."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "694784"
msgid "But I have no pity for you. A dog space?\nYou really put my Master through something\nunspeakably humiliating."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "694896"
msgid "I WILL vindicate #[him][her]#.\nEven if you've grown into an AI\nas powerful as the #C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF itself."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "695012"
msgid "First comes the down payment. This thing\nwon't be enough to sate my wrath, but let's\nhave you pay back a tenth of the debt!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "695136"
msgid "Timelines are irrelevant before\nthe power of love!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "695188"
msgid "I mean, your awful tastes just hit a new low!\nTreating my Darling like a dog is so,\nis so―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "695284"
msgid "Is so―――profound. A doggy, huh?\nHee, hee hee. Hya hee hee. Now I see.\nSo that kind of \"play\" was an option, huh?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "695400"
msgid "Agh! Damn! My old arch-fox-spirit side is\nshowing! Be calm, my many tails… right now I\nhave one; I'm a good wife, serving Darling!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "695532"
msgid "You're inhuman for making my Darling go through\nall that right before my eyes―――Please don't\nthink a slap on the wrist will suffice."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "695668"
msgid "I'm ready! Direct me, #RUBS  Master#RUBEDarling#REND!\nPlease burn the sight of my valiance\ninto your mind once more!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "695788"
msgid "Was this unforeseen to you, woman? \nI'll give you one more thing to be\nastonished about."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "695880"
msgid "I'm an observer no longer.\n#C236196003BB#CDEF. Regardless of your true motives,\nyou have now become my enemy."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "695992"
msgid "#C236196003#FAMILY#CDEF.\nPreviously, I had told you that this was\nyour fight. Forget what I said."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "696092"
msgid "Even if you don't reveal yourself,\nPraetor will be the one to come chase you down!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "696176"
msgid "If you want a fight, just sit there and\nwait quietly. Believe that #C236196003#FAMILY\n#GIVEN#CDEF will go and end your rampage!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "696304"
msgid "Your havoc ends here, #C236196003BB#CDEF!\nThe only one allowed to enter my mind is\nDarling, and that's it! No one invited you!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "696432"
msgid "We will definitely come for your head.\nUntil then, keep that neck nice\nand clean for us."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "696524"
msgid "This is so easy that sleep assails me.\nSuch underlings won't cut it if you wish\nto stop me."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "696616"
msgid "Ah, but there's no need for you to appear.\nToxic insect, hiding in the depths of hell:\nwait alone for your demise to arrive."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "696744"
msgid "You're getting ahead of yourself―――\nUgh, I can't maintain my projection―――\nI'll get you for this, #C236196003#SVT#CDEF…!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "696872"
msgid "#C236196003#SVT#CDEF, who used to be \"instinct,\"\nis also vanishing."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "696940"
msgid "Before me I see #C236196003#SVT#CDEF,\nwhom I was separated from―"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "697008"
msgid "After a very short time / extremely long time,"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "697056"
msgid "of being separated, I can see #C236196003#SVT#CDEF's smile again."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "697124"
msgid "Before me I see #C236196003#SVT#CDEF,\nwhom I was separated from―"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "697192"
msgid "After a very short time / extremely long time,"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "697240"
msgid "of being separated, I'm back with #C236196003Gilgamesh#CDEF again."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "697308"
msgid "…mhm. Don't say anything, Praetor.\nIf you start rambling, I'm not confident that\nI'll be able to hold myself back."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "697424"
msgid "Unfortunately, we have other things we must do.\nNow that #C236196003BB#CDEF has made her objectives clear,\nwe can't ignore her."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "697552"
msgid "…this is the inside of my mind.\nIt's not where you should be lingering around\nforever. To be honest, I get embarrassed."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "697676"
msgid "Close your eyes and relax your mind.\nNow then, we'll return to the battle―――\nno, to where we started, #RUBS  Master#RUBEPraetor#REND!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "697816"
msgid "…sorry about that.\nWhile I've been with you, I made you go through\nsome tough battles. But―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "697916"
msgid "―――But now you look strong.\nIt annoys me to admit this… your inability\nto give up may surpass my former self."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "698032"
msgid "Ah, this isn't the time to be catching our\nbreaths. If #C236196003BB#CDEF's goal is to control the #C000246204Moon\nCell's Core#CDEF, then there's no time to waste."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "698196"
msgid "Close your eyes and let your tension go.\nI'm going to send you back to the outside world."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "698288"
msgid "The battle starts now.\nLet's kick off our big\ncomeback like we always do, Master!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "698372"
msgid "…I think she's smiling *too* much."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "698408"
msgid "As soon as #C236196003Caster#CDEF turned around,\nshe placed her finger on my chest\nand starting spinning it around."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "698524"
msgid "I pushed her away, my hand pressing against\nher cheek scarlet with elation as she tried\nto wriggle in for an embrace."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "698644"
msgid "I honestly just don't get her."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "698676"
msgid "Oooh Dear, you such a tease…\nAfter such a passionate display of courtship,\nif not animals, then lovey-dovey works…鷙"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "698796"
msgid "The path was glass and could've shattered\nas you crossed it. Yet you walked across,\nintent to save me…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "698900"
msgid "Please trust me with this! Though, being a fox,\nI don't approve of dog deities, but I'll bend\nmy beliefs just this onc―ouch!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "699028"
msgid "D-Darling slapped me…!\nEven #ROFS0003#RUBS  Nami#RUBEmother#REND and #RUBS  Nagi#RUBEfather#REND never hit me once!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "699148"
msgid "I'm severely regretting what I've done."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "699188"
msgid "H-hearing you be so disappointed is painful for\nme! I was lying! I was lying about forgetting\nabout #C236196003BB#CDEF! This matter is our top priority!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "699344"
msgid "I understand that well, of course.\nI'm… VERY reluctant to part with you…\nBut how about we get out of this space?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "699460"
msgid "Sure. Leaving is simple, didn't you know?\nI mean, this is my mind."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "699528"
msgid "Now that I've awakened, we can come and go as\nwe please, just like gods!\nErm, well, I AM a deity, though."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "699636"
msgid "Darling, lend me your eyes, ears, and hands.\nGood, shut off your senses and quiet your mind.\nI'll return you to the old school."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "699764"
msgid "What's with that sullen face?\nYou're letting your cheeks loosen.\nDid the tension in you break?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "699860"
msgid "Moron, don't let it get to your head.\nAs the king who governs the land, I simply\ndecided to look into that #C236196003BB#CDEF's rampage."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "700000"
msgid "Our goals merely happened to align.\nThe day will never come when I take your\nlead, mongrel."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "700092"
msgid "Even so, I don't mind."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "700116"
msgid "We didn't even have trust in our relationship before,\nso to start having it now makes me happy and hopeful."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "700224"
msgid "Hmph. You are an unsettling #[man][woman]#.\nWell, so be it. Smile as you please."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "700308"
msgid "I'm going to awaken, what say you?\nI won't stop you if you want to stay,\nbut it'll be for life, you know?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "700416"
msgid "I quickly reply,\n\"That's ridiculous, we'll go back together.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "700480"
msgid "It's true that this isn't the time to overjoyed.\nWe need to get back to the old school as soon as possible\nand check to see if #C236196003Rin#CDEF and the others are okay!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "700652"
msgid "I see. Then close your eyes and vacate\nyour mind. I'm going to knock your mind back\nto the outside world."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "700760"
msgid "Our journey will take some time. Meanwhile,\ndo your best to relax yourself. The wounds\non your body are not so shallow."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "700880"
msgid "#C080080080―――My consciousness contracts and expands.\n      Along with my consciousness,\n      there's a course that seems to be shifting\n      into another world.#CDEF"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "701052"
msgid "#C080080080My soul detaches from my body and from the world;\nI'm transferring to the space where #C236196003#FAMILY #GIVEN#CDEF#C080080080\nbelongs, to the dimension I'm tuned to.#C080080080#CDEF"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "701248"
msgid "#C080080080Midway, my mind calmly considers what\nhappened \"until now\" and the future \"from this point on.\"#CDEF"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "701360"
msgid "#C236196003Leo#CDEF#C080080080 was defeated, and #CDEF#C236196003Julius#CDEF#C080080080 took his leave.#CDEF"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "701472"
msgid "#C236196003BB#CDEF#C080080080's power was too overwhelming.#CDEF"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "701540"
msgid "#C080080080Beating #C236196003Lancer#CDEF#C080080080 and the #CDEF#C000246204Alter Ego#CDEF#C080080080 wasn't enough\nto resolve our dilemma.#C080080080#CDEF"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "701700"
msgid "#C080080080…were we really ever capable of winning against\nsomeone with a privilege skill of that caliber?#CDEF"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "701816"
msgid "#C080080080If she ends up gaining control of the #CDEF#C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF#C080080080,\nthen human civilization―or perhaps the Earth\nitself―may meet its demise.#CDEF"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "701988"
msgid "#C080080080―――We have to stop #CDEF#C236196003BB#CDEF#C080080080, no matter what.#CDEF"
msgstr ""

